### Count Consistency

#### detects count sum exceeding test_count

- Verify: detects count sum exceeding test_count


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 20 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: detects count sum exceeding test_count")
val run = create_test_run(
    "count_overflow_1",
    "Completed",
    hours_ago(2),
    hours_ago(1),
    getpid(),
    10,  # test_count
    8,   # passed
    3,   # failed (8 + 3 = 11 > 10)
    0,
    0
)
val report = validate_run(run)

expect(report.has_violations()).to_be(true)

val count_found = report.violations.filter(_1.violation_type == "CountInconsistent")
expect(count_found.len() > 0).to_be(true)
```

</details>

